OL,3,GNEWSAJump in energy bills drives UK
OL,4,Ainflation to highest rate for four
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is the highest rate of inflation
OL,8,Fsince March, but some price rises have
OL,9,Fslowed: food inflation, at 1.3%, is at
OL,10,Fits lowest rate for close to five
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FExperts say Wednesday's inflation
OL,14,Ffigure is unlikely to influence the
OL,15,FBank of England to change its key
OL,16,Finterest rate at its next meeting in
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
